le se-module-text\">\n                                    <!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-111f45f5-f5e9-4ab2-9741-a8967c00d545\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-f258eb0e-d5b0-41b9-ae39-5f7eb742e027\">안녕하세요. </span><span style=\"color:#0078cb;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b4232d63-25a8-4642-9acc-b429c5a1ba46\"><b>승리의 여신: 니케</b></span><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-898b0eeb-d86d-41c8-89bd-6c5aab448c4d\">입니다.​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-0a8ff7d6-6d80-4c91-a812-71c220fd95ea\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-eea018bd-7905-48a1-893c-97d058a2a8a2\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-f64754bd-248f-4b35-90c8-32b93158c56d\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-fbd1b831-3a14-44cb-974f-8354c6acaaab\">12/12(목) 15:00 ~ 16:00 경에 무점검 업데이트 및</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c73e8aad-ddb5-44df-8b9c-ac194bc57723\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-21655b0b-1178-41bf-bdc4-30e57f2f4e5a\">업데이트 리소스 다운로드가 진행되었습니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-e81f0482-d7f2-4846-a466-655cae346748\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a1a94a58-2b33-4866-9ca7-04ead707463f\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-12bf9439-9081-45ab-b555-e725ad42a7c7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-7e567317-38d4-4520-8ac8-7e931258a26c\">​​자세한 설명은 아래를 확인해 주시기 바랍니다.​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-1fbdfa2e-d57f-4e88-bb28-75496de7fdb0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-8c556509-d00f-4f2d-b3d6-417e941256fd\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-fcd06401-5645-4fd2-b499-edbd5626f1dc\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-2a9afea7-3d43-43c6-b17e-e9e13eb700ac\">​·····················································································</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-75ec35ff-be7e-4c4b-9cf1-c2984c7dbd38\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs- se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-1a86af54-fa79-43da-a69f-cda4cd4dc7fb\"><b>📢 12월 12일(목) 무점검 업데이트 안내​​</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-b3303d67-4283-4573-b040-b7d1ce75a717\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6ad535a5-b63a-4645-a8cc-fb4009503208\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2ebdac84-34c8-432b-aba1-d71a95afe63b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-c092fb46-86c8-4459-a0c6-1016fa114bc7\"><b>​✔️ 일시</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-4095b11f-5ebd-4265-97da-f7740fb61ef7\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-cab40449-a31b-4a41-afc6-782620bf9dc3\">- 12/12(목) 15:00 ~ 16:00 경​​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-db91aa59-d0f9-4cc6-90b8-2e62fb710df1\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-6b67bd8e-6af9-43b0-b902-a1a418097423\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-5d56fc80-2a47-49a3-beec-47da9ddf74c2\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-b7dd4f6e-adc4-44a3-8006-d5c33b470e28\"><b>​✔️ 내용</b></span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-33ae5750-e923-4481-b081-0d5f1eac22a0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-aec5a89a-3509-46ad-8540-46bf6b3c717c\">- 메이든 : 아이스 로즈 버스트 스킬 「다이아몬드 더스트」가 특정 상황에서 조준선에 가장 가까운 적이 아닌 다른 적에게 적중하는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-c2e5cd24-f319-4257-81a0-cac6ea4cd893\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-9ee0083c-ab21-4b16-b30e-455c09a1bc15\">- 메이든 : 아이스 로즈의 스탠딩 모션에서 특정 부위의 디자인이 표시되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-8513a820-def9-4ecd-8e6c-86aefd502600\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-d6281351-c90b-4401-9ef0-f7a943acc97a\">- 미니 게임 DRAGON DUNGEON RUN에서 캐릭터의 이동 음성이 재생되는 빈도를 조정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ec19f0f6-3e22-4fce-a6fe-539df37de73b\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a6acb2da-4ec6-4397-ad1e-22448fd688bf\">- 스토리 이벤트 ICE DRAGON SAGA의 STORY II 「ICE DRAGON SAGA : B」 에서 일부 BGM이 재생되지 않는 현상을 수정하였습니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-562fd9e9-c0f0-4ccb-83a6-6d329be49e6c\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a72489a4-0ac3-4120-b1cf-933fc27185b5\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-2c516c8c-0392-43e2-90d6-d7bea668dd8b\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-21947aca-2d87-49d0-9302-01d1884d9802\">​※ 게임 재접속 후 업데이트 리소스 다운로드를 부탁드립니다.</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-7a3bfbcf-0ef9-4553-aa42-9c644cbfe07c\"><span style=\"color:#ba0000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-a5338444-6a7d-4ea2-b726-5a6ce53d2bc7\">​※ 인앱 구매(확률형 아이템 포함)​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-59cbcf13-01c1-44c1-b30b-422afea52fd0\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-35ad0d5b-9577-49f3-a5d4-3df7d69afe0d\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-ca3daddc-c0d6-403a-a9f9-396fdd09a814\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-765327ca-5a96-48f6-bf85-d67ec7a7cf57\">·····················································································​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-3dc4b931-0bf9-4a46-858b-8e8ad6389ef6\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumgothic   \" id=\"SE-5e0cc5e6-b3f3-48fb-9294-38da9b62f41b\">​</span></p><!-- } SE-TEXT --><!-- SE-TEXT { --><p class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"\" id=\"SE-dff22439-7dc5-48fe-8545-5acaf1591e69\"><span style=\"color:#000000;\" class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-nanumg